    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "What came first? The music or the misery? People worry about kids playing with guns and watching violent videos, we're scared that some sort of culture of violence is taking them over..."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 2,
        "line": 1050,
        "text": "Thanks for the enthusiastic intro, Rob. We're not called Sonic Death Monkey anymore, though, ladies and gentlemen. We might be on the verge of becoming the Atavistics, but we haven't decided yet. But tonight, we are... BARRY JIVE AND THE UPTOWN FIVE!"
      }
